  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ODAS West Africa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ODAS West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom detta projekt har Le Centre ODAS ett &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l, vilket &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka regionalt ledarskap och kollektiva &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder f&#xf6;r s&#xe4;ker abort i frankofona Afrika.
Mer specifikt kommer detta projekt att g&#xf6;ra det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r oss att genomf&#xf6;ra tre m&#xe5;l:
&#x2022; Specifikt m&#xe5;l 1: St&#xe4;rka samordning, anpassning och institutionellt ledarskap f&#xf6;r s&#xe4;ker abort i frankofona Afrika.
&#x2022; Specifikt m&#xe5;l 2: F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra teknisk, politisk och ledarskapskapacitet f&#xf6;r evidensbaserat p&#xe5;verkansarbete.
&#x2022; Specifikt m&#xe5;l 3: F&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rka regionalt p&#xe5;verkansarbete, kommunikation och synlighet f&#xf6;r r&#xe4;ttigheter till s&#xe4;ker abort.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, Le Centre ODAS has a general objective, which is to strengthen regional leadership and collective action for safe abortion in Francophone Africa.
Specifically, this project will allow us to implement 03 objectives:
&#x2022; Specific objective 1: Strengthen coordination, alignment and institutional leadership for safe abortion in Francophone Africa.
&#x2022; Specific objective 2: Enhance technical, political and leadership capacities for evidence-based advocacy.
&#x2022; Specific objective 3: Amplify regional advocacy, communication, and visibility of safe abortion rights.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, Le Centre ODAS has a general objective, which is to strengthen regional leadership and collective action for safe abortion in Francophone Africa.

Specifically, this project will implement three objectives:

&#x2022;Specific objective 1: Strengthen coordination, alignment and institutional leadership for safe abortion in Francophone Africa.
&#x2022; Specific objective 2: Enhance technical, political and leadership capacities for evidence-based advocacy.
&#x2022; Specific objective 3: Amplify regional advocacy, communication, and visibility of safe abortion rights.</narrative>
  </description>
